      "text/markdown": [
       "**[188] Split keyword** — *i feel kinda weird when andrea tries to talk to me about chris*  \n",
       "gold **fear**, BERT **surprise (0.77)**, TF-IDF + LR **fear**, BiLSTM **surprise**; occlusion: weird (+0.74)  \n",
       "weird is labelled fear 43 times and surprise 34 times in the training split. The context (an awkward conversation about another person) fits either reading, so neither label can be derived from the text: the gold label is effectively a coin flip between the two classes the annotation assigns to this word."
      ],
      "text/plain": [
       "<IPython.core.display.Markdown object>"
